      "content": "wait, a heart attack?? that seems like such a huge jump to make. i literally just told you i haven't slept and my boss is being a nightmare. i get this exact same heavy feeling every time i have a panic attack or a really bad anxiety spike. it's miserable, but it always goes away once i can just sit still and relax for a bit. are you sure it's not just my nerves getting the better of me? i'm really trying to avoid a huge hospital bill and the chaos of an ER if i can help it.",
